  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://bank.sbi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">State Bank of India (SBI)</a> </span>has released the notification for the post of Specialist Officer (Vice President Wealth (SRM), Assistant Vice President Wealth (RM), Customer Relationship Executive). This recruitment has been issued for 996 posts. Online applying process for SBI Bank SO Recruitment 2026 has started from 02 December 2025 &amp; the candidates can apply till 10 January 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for SBI SCO Trade Finance Officer Recruitment 2025 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">State Bank of India (SBI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SBI Bank SO Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt No. : CRPD/SCO/2025-26/17</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>02 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>02 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>10 January 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>10 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SBI Bank SO Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">VP Wealth (SRM) <strong>: 26-42 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">AVP Wealth (RM) <strong>: 23-35 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Customer Rel. Executive&nbsp;<strong>: 20-35 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SBI Bank SO Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SBI SO 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 996 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Vice President Wealth (Senior Relationship Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">506</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Customer Relationship Executive</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">284</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Vice President Wealth (Relationship Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">206</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SBI SO Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">VP Wealth (SRM)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7804%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduation Degree in any stream from any recognized University / Institute will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">MBA (Banking/ Finance/ Marketing) with 60% from recognized University or Institution.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Certifications such as NISM V-A, XXI-A, CFP /CFA</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">6 years into sales &amp; marketing with leading Public / Private / Foreign Banks/ Wealth Management Firms / AMCs</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Customer Relationship Executive</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7804%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduation Degree in any stream from any recognized University / Institute with&nbsp;Knowledge of Local Language will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Weightage will be given to the candidates with post-graduation in finance / marketing / Banking.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Certifications such as NISM V-A, XXI-A, CFP/CFA</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">3 years into sales &amp; marketing with leading Public / Private / Foreign Banks/ Wealth Management Firms/ AMCs /SBI Wealth CREs having 4 years of experience </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">AVP Wealth (RM)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7804%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduation Degree in any stream from any recognized University / Institute will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SBI SO Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://bank.sbi/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the SBI before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SarkariResult2026</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for SBI SO recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SBI SCO Trade Finance Officer Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shortlisting</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://recruitment.sbi.bank.in/crpd-sco-2025-26-17/apply\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Date Extend Notice</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\